   "text": "# Accounts and Access\n\n## Password reset\n\nUsers reset passwords themselves at lanekeep.com/reset. Reset emails come from\nno-reply@lanekeep.com and expire after 60 minutes. Support cannot set or read\npasswords.\n\n## Two-factor authentication\n\n2FA (TOTP) is available on all plans. If a user loses their authenticator and\ntheir recovery codes, identity must be verified by a human agent before 2FA can\nbe removed \u2014 the support assistant should escalate these cases with priority high.\n\n## Data export and deletion\n\nWorkspace admins can export all workspace data (JSON/CSV) from **Settings \u2192\nWorkspace \u2192 Export**. Account deletion requests are processed within 30 days and\nare irreversible; they must be confirmed from the account owner's email address.\n\n## SSO (Enterprise)\n\nSAML SSO is configured under **Settings \u2192 Security \u2192 SSO**. Changes to SSO\nconfiguration require a workspace owner and take effect within 15 minutes.\n",
